Map native YT921x QinQ ports to exact qosmio physical/leaf interfaces.

The normal netdev-wide NSS lookup declines QinQ ports. Ported IPv4/IPv6
frontends resolve each routed side independently and program both wire
tags. Missing/ambiguous nodes, direct port VLAN uppers, tunnels and L2
flows stay on the host. No Kuncy7 ECM14 source files are substituted.

